    "title": "Welcome to Nexatools — 30+ tools in one place",
    "excerpt": "Meet Nexatools: a single, clean hub for the file, image, PDF, developer and AI tools you use every week. Here's a tour of what's inside and how we built it.",
    "content": "# Welcome to Nexatools\n\nEvery week most of us bounce between a dozen little utility sites — one for compressing an image, another for merging PDFs, a third for formatting JSON, plus whichever AI tool the group chat is talking about. **Nexatools** puts all of those in one place, behind one login, with one clean design.\n\n## What's inside V1\n\n- **PDF** — merge, split, compress, PDF ↔ Word, OCR, and chat with any PDF using AI.\n- **Image** — resize, compress, convert to PDF, and remove backgrounds.\n- **AI** — summarize, translate, rewrite, and generate speech.\n- **Developer** — JSON formatter, Base64, URL encoder, JWT decoder, regex tester, hash and password generators, and more.\n\nEvery tool has its own page with a plain-English \"how to use\" section, an about block and an FAQ — so if you land on us from Google you get an answer, not just a form.\n\n## Free forever for the utilities\n\nThe developer and file utilities run **entirely in your browser**. Nothing is uploaded, and there's no ads on the tool itself. You don't even need an account to use them.\n\nThe AI tools cost credits because they run on real GPUs. New accounts get 10 credits refilled daily on the Free plan; Pro ($20/month) removes the cap.\n\n## What's next\n\nWe ship a new batch of tools every month. Next up: an image pixelator, batch renaming, a QR generator and a link shortener. If there's a tool you want, [email us](mailto:hello@nexatools.cloud) or drop a request from the dashboard.\n\nHappy building.",
