    "title": "5 AI workflows that turn any PDF into a research assistant",
    "excerpt": "PDFs hide most of the world's knowledge in a format designed to be printed, not read. Here are five workflows that turn any PDF into a searchable, summarizable, conversational research partner.",
    "content": "# 5 AI workflows that turn any PDF into a research assistant\n\nContracts. Research papers. Financial reports. Manuals. The most important documents in your life are almost always PDFs — and PDFs are almost always painful to read. Here are five workflows we use every day at Nexatools to make PDFs actually useful.\n\n## 1. Summarize before you read\n\nDrop the PDF into [Chat PDF](/tools/chat-pdf) and start with \"Summarize this document in 5 bullet points, then list the 3 questions I should ask about it.\" You'll know in 30 seconds whether it's worth 30 minutes.\n\n## 2. Extract structured data\n\nInvoices, receipts, tables — ask \"Return every line item as JSON with columns: description, quantity, unit_price, total.\" AI is now reliable enough to replace 90% of manual data entry.\n\n## 3. Translate in place\n\nCombine our [PDF-to-Word](/tools/pdf-to-word) tool with the [Translate](/tools/translate) tool to translate a document while keeping the original layout.\n\n## 4. Compare two versions\n\nUpload version A and version B, then ask \"What are the substantive changes between these two contracts?\" Faster than any diff tool and it explains the *meaning* of the change, not just the text.\n\n## 5. Search across a folder\n\nIf you have a stack of research papers, batch-OCR the scanned ones with our [OCR tool](/tools/ocr), then feed the extracted text into Chat PDF. You now have a searchable, questionable knowledge base — no expensive vector DB required.\n\n## The stack we recommend\n\n1. [OCR](/tools/ocr) → make sure the PDF has real text.\n2. [PDF Compressor](/tools/pdf-compressor) → keep uploads fast.\n3. [Chat PDF](/tools/chat-pdf) → ask anything.\n4. [Summarize](/tools/summarize) → generate briefs for teammates.\n5. [Translate](/tools/translate) → cross the language gap.\n\nAll five are one click from the [Nexatools homepage](/). Free credits refill daily, no card required.",
